<bioghist encodinganalog="545$a">
<head>Biographical/Historical Information 
</head>
<p>The Woolen Mills Union Chapel was built by the Charlottesville Woolen Mill employees as a non-denominational chapel in 1887.
</p>
</bioghist>

<scopecontent encodinganalog="520$a">
<head>Scope and Content
</head>
<p>The minute books name persons attending the chapel Sunday school, programs of service, and resolutions at the death of member.
</p>
</scopecontent>

